# Tekrion project memory and session handoff

This is the durable handoff for future Codex sessions working on Tekrion.
Read it before changing the repository. Product documentation remains
authoritative for implementation details.

Never put passwords, npm tokens, 2FA codes, signing keys, API keys, control
tokens, account identifiers, or captured user evidence in this file.

